---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Culture, Music & Communication — Devina Azaria" description="Curated historical culture and communication material from Devina Azaria's legacy archive, with provenance boundaries kept explicit.">
  <section class="shell section page-intro">
    <div class="eyebrow">Journal · Culture & Creative</div>
    <h1>Culture, Music & Communication</h1>
    <p class="lead">The legacy site mixed personal learning, editorial writing, music material, commerce, and general web content. This page keeps only the historical material that still supports Devina's culture and communication story without overstating authorship.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="journey-list">
      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-year">18 Apr 2025</div>
        <div>
          <h2>Evolusi Desain Kebaya</h2>
          <p class="muted">A legacy editorial article about the development of kebaya from traditional forms to modern design. It is retained as historical culture-related writing, not as research or a competition record.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://archive.devina.id/evolusi-desain-kebaya-dari-tradisional-ke-sentuhan-modern/">Open legacy article ↗</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-year">Ongoing</div>
        <div>
          <h2>Performance and cultural practice</h2>
          <p class="muted">Macapat, geguritan, storytelling, music, and performance are better represented through dated achievements, recordings, programs, photographs, and reflections than through generic editorial posts. Verified records therefore remain in the Achievements section rather than being duplicated here.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/achievements/">Open verified achievements →</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-year">Review closed</div>
        <div>
          <h2>Legacy lyric and music pages</h2>
          <p class="muted">Lyrics and music-related pages from the old site are not migrated into the personal journal unless authorship and rights can be verified. This keeps the portfolio from presenting uncertain or third-party material as Devina's own work.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="tag">Editorial Rule</div>
      <div class="big">Culture is strongest when practice and evidence stay connected.</div>
      <p class="muted">Historical writing can show curiosity, but the portfolio gives greater weight to Devina's documented participation, performances, awards, recordings, reflection, and role clarity.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button secondary" href="/journal/">Back to Journal <span aria-hidden="true">←</span></a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/achievements/">Culture evidence <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
